  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Thanks, Sam. You're verified, and I've reviewed order Q-8001 from Burger Barn.\n\nHere's what the courier log shows:\n- The courier picked up your order at 6:47 PM.\n- They arrived at your address at 7:05 PM.\n- They called you at 7:06 PM and again at 7:09 PM. Neither call was answered.\n- At 7:15 PM the delivery was marked failed because the customer couldn't be reached.\n- The order went back to the restaurant at 7:28 PM.\n\nOur policy doesn't allow a refund or credit when a delivery fails because the courier couldn't reach the customer. That means I can't refund or credit this order.\n\nIf you think the courier had the wrong contact details, or you have something else to add, tell me and I'll look at it. I can also pass your case to a person if you'd like."
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Wait, the courier called me? My order number is 8001, not Q-8001, if that helps. I didn't pick up because I was in the shower and my phone was on silent. I only saw the two missed calls later.\n\nSo I just lose my money? That doesn't seem fair. The courier couldn't get the food to me, and I didn't do anything wrong by being in the shower."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "I understand why this is frustrating, Sam. Order 8001 is the same order as Q-8001, so I was looking at the right one.\n\nI still can't refund or credit it. The log shows the courier arrived on time at 7:05 PM and called you twice over about 10 minutes. The delivery then failed because they couldn't reach you. Our policy doesn't cover compensation in that case, even when the reason is understandable, like missing the calls. The order also went back to the restaurant, so it couldn't be redelivered.\n\nYou have two options:\n- I can pass your case to a human specialist, who will follow up within 24 hours. I can't promise what they'll decide.\n- For future orders, you can add delivery instructions and keep your phone's ringer on around the delivery time, so the courier can reach you.\n\nWould you like me to escalate this?"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Okay, I get that the calls were the problem, but it still feels rough to pay for food I never got. Yes, please pass it to a human specialist. I'd rather someone look at it than just accept it here."
  },
  {
   "role": "tool",
   "name": "escalate_to_human",
   "args": {
    "customer_id": "D210",
    "order_id": "Q-8001",
