    "summary": "Order Q-8001 (Burger Barn, $28.03) failed delivery: courier arrived 19:05, two unanswered calls, marked delivery_failed (customer_unreachable) at 19:15, returned to restaurant 19:28. Per policy section 6, no refund or credit was given. Customer says he was in the shower with phone on silent, is unhappy about paying for food he did not receive, and asked for a human to review."
   },
